id: pm-gh1371
title: "GH-1371: compose output budget and producer pagination"
description: "Implement existing GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1371. Presentation-only universal output controls must not alter producer fingerprints; every emitted count must match its delivered rows."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-01T09:24:20.761Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-01T18:58:27.318Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#25a4e59e3a757fa1c2538e8e"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Advertised output and producer cursors retrieve every matching ID;Continued focus collections have no duplicated IDs;Delivered counts and hidden status receipts agree with emitted rows;Population and count-only totals remain intact;CLI and SDK filter changes reject cursors and field projection remains compatible
parent: pm-doxj
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: "Count-only aggregate totals survive field, amount and budget projection; replay fixtures remain private and continuation preserves tracker/query semantics."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
